g a convergence hypothesis. Every application in the archived argument satisfies that hypothesis, so no proposition and no step of the argument changes. This change is not covered by the recorded audit and is flagged in \texttt{changes.md} for the project owner's acknowledgement. The other items in group~(c) concern only the exposition of this text, for example an arithmetic slip in an earlier version of the write-up, and do not touch the archived arguments. Agreement between models is evidence, not certification; the arguments are reproduced here in full so that they can be checked directly.

